<p local-id=3D"d20aa800-c548-4d56-baca-f956838a5a85">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"4580132c-ebbf-4341-bd8a-b5cbed640c72">The pipelines and envi=
ronment records created for this project are in DEV02,</p>
<p local-id=3D"006a8c02-0099-4abc-9238-4e3af56a1402">To see the Environment=
s create please go to <strong>Environments </strong>section in the Navigati=
on Bar</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"6227b32f-e14d-4041-bcd0-9c718f53fd79" id=3D"TechnicalDetail=
s-Environments">Environments</h2>
<p local-id=3D"f5e14a35-6964-4d2f-84f0-9a7bb8ee39ea">The environments are u=
sed to define how a power platform environment will be used in the pipeline=
 process. The following Environments were created for use in the pipelines:=
</p>
<ul local-id=3D"8d3367c8-9830-4ad0-8280-ca8662d93b67">
<li local-id=3D"cbad14e1-5792-48fc-bff4-38bc406c8391">
<p local-id=3D"0632587e-8b38-4e3b-b406-6f958eaf1f46">WRB-DynamicsCRM-DEV01<=
/p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"40fa8936-ea9e-495d-bceb-9630edac0a16">
<p local-id=3D"5bd22433-bc80-44db-914f-f867717fa96b">WRB-DynamicsCRM-TST01<=
/p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"05e895ef-2150-470b-ac0d-d12f5b4bb0a5">
<p local-id=3D"04bb6222-78fc-401a-99c2-7111040b3f6f">WRB-DynamicsCRM-UAT</p=
>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"58d63f0f3cf0">
<p local-id=3D"3c1b5c29bb0b">WRB-DynamicsCRM-PRD01</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"4144a940-43f5-4acc-a514-4391ced0945e">Below are the fields r=
equested when created an Environment record.</p>
<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflu=
ence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-ce=
nter" alt=3D"image-20260106-213721.png" width=3D"300" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"44e4bfaaa9bec06aa1de3984347b9fa738c22fab20224b9667ce70ed2ea4edb4" data-=
image-src=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/1504=
706565/image-20260106-213721.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1767738=
411656&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"510" data-width=3D=
"492" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"150398=
5687" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attac=
hment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-20260106-213721.png" dat=
a-base-url=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-co=
ntent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1504706565" d=
ata-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5" data-media-id=3D"c4c58ab6-59ba-=
4e8f-be8c-b90906d1ae78" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"311"></span>
<ul local-id=3D"67223dad-0ec6-423b-b7b0-d6be3c4af306">
<li local-id=3D"39bcfc8f-24d4-4dbc-953e-93d7e853f6d1">
<p local-id=3D"522a9a1f-ddbd-46b9-926a-95924f2f2df0"><strong>Name: </strong=
> Name of the Environment record</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"53d819e7-40b8-4ab7-aaa3-f367e116b6f4">
<p local-id=3D"7ea3abf8-2617-4971-95c8-25399117eb2d"><strong>Owner: </stron=
g>Owner of the Environment record</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"dcf4fb0a-107e-4267-bf86-f24f208e7a4e">
<p local-id=3D"de09918e-787c-4a9f-9144-4d6d6fe20279"><strong>Environment Ty=
pe: </strong>please choose if the environment is either <em>Deployment Envi=
ronment, </em>or <em>Target Environment</em>, this can only be set when cre=
ating a record</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"f7af7d21-f9a3-4ffc-adf9-cef85f78a675">
<p local-id=3D"956bbbeb-4f52-4904-8bca-67fb03ee8c04"><strong>Environment ID=
: </strong>Environment ID of the environment, this can only be set when cre=
ating the record</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"05b3601f-c0ec-41a5-aeab-081abcc6b35d">
<p local-id=3D"9a44c14b-4033-4e4b-b407-090b6bda6926"><strong>Validation Sta=
tus:</strong> Shows if the Environment status, the status is validated ever=
y time you create or update an environment record to see if it=E2=80=99s av=
ailable to be used</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"638295a3-3cc3-4627-b04b-edde7f396755">
<p local-id=3D"b9d24adc-64fc-44f4-ab27-f7a2c8c4fb03"><strong>Error Message:=
 </strong>Shows the Error message in case the Validation Failed.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"bef24a9c-6289-4eca-9b7e-70cedc5a49e8">
<p local-id=3D"1cf38eb9-d5e4-439a-bc05-9f71228a8b83"><strong>Description:</=
strong> Brief description of the Environment record.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"935a27ab-c799-45ce-a37a-e92fb1072ddc">&nbsp;</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"6746f2da-96ab-4b69-ab83-f35116f3cfd4" id=3D"TechnicalDetail=
s-DeploymentPipelines">Deployment Pipelines</h2>
<p local-id=3D"057093ff-70e1-4b73-bc16-651f7b2b8e0d">The Deployment pipelin=
es, defines the development and target environments that will be used for i=
ts scope, you can have multiple deployment pipelines depending on the proje=
ct needs. The pipeline created for this project is called <strong>Standard =
Deployment Pipeline</strong>.</p>
<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflu=
ence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-ce=
nter" alt=3D"image-20260106-210823.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"9b546fccb7a12958ecb9fbfb9fb12b9e41fefa26fdb29ddd07cad7797ef207aa" data-=
image-src=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/1504=
