-44b9-ab6c-fe1cdeff619d" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"75"></span>
<h2 local-id=3D"0143dcb6-1b1a-407c-902a-d87a5ed643dc" id=3D"TechnicalDetail=
s-DeploymentStages">Deployment Stages</h2>
<p local-id=3D"ef2c73e8-b399-4820-82a0-9b673c539cfd">The deployment stage d=
efines the target environment, and the stage options, below are the fields =
used when creating a deployment stage.</p>
<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflu=
ence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-ce=
nter" alt=3D"image-20260106-215458.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"4c021418530191c02364f04d7f4bdbfe92b302d2d6715a5a8c1ab09c3eec78ae" data-=
image-src=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/1504=
706565/image-20260106-215458.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1767738=
411802&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"714" data-width=3D=
"1334" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"15039=
85711" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"atta=
chment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-20260106-215458.png" da=
ta-base-url=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-c=
ontent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1504706565" =
data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5" data-media-id=3D"d3646d9d-aa2e=
-48b7-b5f7-c8698559e683" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"250"></span>
<p local-id=3D"065556b7-0907-4b24-bbf4-3889fd2e199d">Note: The fields borde=
red at the beginning are part of the deployment pipeline environment relate=
d to the deployment stage record (Quick view form).</p>
<ul local-id=3D"21aba15b-2e37-4f0c-82e9-576671bcf4fe">
<li local-id=3D"e29fb525-0a7f-465c-8248-3a0062280800">
<p local-id=3D"09c2b15a-13b6-4500-8673-4c38c6f1f928"><strong>Name:</strong>=
 Name of the Deployment stage record</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"45e142fa-9c4e-4cba-8017-b43a839013ce">
<p local-id=3D"06977017-c016-43d1-9d3b-c759851d18b1"><strong>Owner: </stron=
g>Owner of the deployment Stage Record</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"51d6426b-6419-4c0c-beae-a77ee3d00316">
<p local-id=3D"00d876f1-0234-4f61-9767-d52aa66912ce"><strong>Description: <=
/strong>Brief description of the deployment stage</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"3ac7fb2f-650c-4880-90d4-9bb6cbe98f2d">
<p local-id=3D"dec9d8ad-e8ca-4ba6-940c-cadb1a6890b6"><strong>Deployment Pip=
eline: </strong>Deployment pipeline related to the Deployment Stage record.=
</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"b299b24a-205c-4b73-9b51-12363e045816">
<p local-id=3D"57edd9a1-b2ab-4b1f-91db-4f77db7f4603"><strong>Previous Deplo=
yment Stage: </strong>In case the deployment stage needs to be run in seque=
nce, you can select the previous deployment stage and related to this recor=
d.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"64f4db0f-4016-4cc4-9028-43e7a9838bce">
<p local-id=3D"8e684835-c887-4850-9188-5a6497a9dfe6"><strong>Target Deploym=
ent Environment ID: </strong>The environment the pipeline will target one a=
 solution is deployed.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"bbec7464-8c15-4c3a-9bb9-2ce42a7465c1">
<p local-id=3D"c796d4ad-81aa-4fb9-acdb-d0ab621585ed"><strong>Pre-Export Ste=
p Required: </strong>Please check this option if there's a Pre-Export Step =
required, the pre-export step needs to be created on Power Automate.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"2f13220b-b22e-46ec-b575-1dcd360d9868">
<p local-id=3D"f12d2c24-c7b0-42a1-9093-e4ef9b4be0a2"><strong>Pre-Deployment=
 Step Required: </strong>Please check this option if there's a Pre-Deployme=
nt Step required, the pre-deployment step needs to be created on Power Auto=
mate.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"35f0c0e8-17a6-4499-b95a-567d649f7f7e">
<p local-id=3D"8381539f-913a-49bd-b2d4-d57141f848e1"><strong>Is Delegated D=
eployment: </strong>Please check this option if this is a delegated deploym=
ent stage, an <em>OnApprovalStarted</em> step needs to be created on Power =
Automate.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"63262add-e673-49b1-91ac-6705202f1f19">To better understand h=
ow the pre steps mentioned above work, please visit <a class=3D"external-li=
nk" href=3D"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-platform/alm/extend-pip=
elines" rel=3D"nofollow"><u>Extend pipelines in Power Platform - Power Plat=
form | Microsoft Learn</u></a></p>
<p local-id=3D"c687e74d-37e9-471a-9141-fba47bcadc35"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"d215a17c-c300-4c45-a7ce-b2a557fd6e1b" id=3D"TechnicalDetail=
s-DelegatedDeploymentCloudflow">Delegated Deployment Cloud flow</h2>
<p local-id=3D"8d609272-20b1-4aa9-8bfe-a746d2dd562f">In order to delegate t=
he deployments so everything is owned by the SPN <strong>svc-ent-d-pwpdyn02=
</strong>, you need to create a cloud flow that will approve the request on=
 its behalf, this flow is located in the <strong>Dev02 </strong>environment=
. Below is the logic used to create the flow, the logic is simple but can b=
e extended depending on the needs and complexity of the deployment.</p>
<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflu=
ence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-ce=
nter" alt=3D"image-20260106-221744.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"8277ecf94a482346a9cde4438e5a19cebb58eb612bee4b8d46b47dccb4b6c4c5" data-=
image-src=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/1504=
706565/image-20260106-221744.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1767738=
411838&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"452" data-width=3D=
"650" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"150398=
5717" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attac=
hment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-20260106-221744.png" dat=
a-base-url=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-co=
ntent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1504706565" d=
ata-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5" data-media-id=3D"82e4e5b3-792b-=
4cb9-abd8-fed69aeb00d9" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"325"></span>
<p local-id=3D"5ca62e86-da72-493b-aa7a-77e351c42c1f">As shown above, when y=
ou check the <strong>Is Delegated Deployment </strong>field in the deployme=
nt stage record, it=E2=80=99ll start an <em>OnApprovalStarted </em>action, =
when it detects the action, this flow will trigger. once it-s triggered, it=
 just gets approved in the <strong>Approve Delegated Deployment Action </st=
rong>step, the action to call will be <em>UpdateApprovalStatus</em>, with t=
he status of 20 (approved), for more details regarding the extension of thi=
s flow, feel free to consult the link mentioned <a class=3D"external-link" =
href=3D"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-platform/alm/extend-pipelin=
es" rel=3D"nofollow"><u>above</u></a>.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"a126c890d4da" id=3D"TechnicalDetails-Deploymentflows">Deplo=
yment flows</h2>
<p local-id=3D"3c8d7f9a31f6">For different deployment requirements, there w=
ere created two flows listed below, this flows are in the solution <strong>=
WRB_Deployment_Pipeline_Processes</strong> in dev02</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"c3c59417b85d" id=3D"TechnicalDetails-ProdDeploymentapproval=
">Prod Deployment approval</h2>
<p local-id=3D"8cb85bf5ac64">In order for a solution to be deployed into Pr=
oduction, it needs to be approved firs, the approval is done by the <strong=
>Pipeline - Send Approval request for prod deployment</strong>&nbsp;flow, t=
his flow will stop on pending until it gets approved by any member on the <=
strong>Production Approvers </strong>team, located in dev02 environment, on=
ce it gets approved, or rejected, the flow will continue.</p>
<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflu=
ence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-ce=
nter" alt=3D"image-20260417-204505.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"d6fa8aea85da63b2268a543dc4267e1bd54f32bcb0bf9371dcf2e625c97f2433" data-=
image-src=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/1504=
706565/image-20260417-204505.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1776458=
706851&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"693" data-width=3D=
"678" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"195569=
2576" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attac=
hment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-20260417-204505.png" dat=
a-base-url=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-co=
ntent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1504706565" d=
ata-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5" data-media-id=3D"64f0fa9d-8327-=
4f4f-976e-babb89da881d" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"477"></span>
<p local-id=3D"d43667777beb"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"a3b6b232-c3e8-443a-aeaa-87eeb0ec2a95" id=3D"TechnicalDetail=
s-SolutionsDeployed">Solutions Deployed</h2>
<p local-id=3D"1f4433b8-648c-4ed4-b753-4aadf1246c56">All solutions deployed=
 through the pipelines, will be deployed as <strong>Staged Upgrades</strong=
>, this is an Out-Of-Box feature, for mor info on the different deployment =
types, please visit <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://learn.micros=
oft.com/en-us/power-apps/maker/data-platform/update-solutions" rel=3D"nofol=
low">Update a solution - Power Apps | Microsoft Learn</a></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
